# Crenet Games Canonical AI Agent & Search Ignore (.aiignore)
# Managed via governance submodule (`./governance/setup.sh`).
# Vendor-specific ignore files (.geminiignore, .aiexclude, .cursorignore, .claudeignore,
# .clineignore, .rooignore, .aiderignore, .codeiumignore, .rgignore) symlink to `.aiignore`.

# Dependencies & Virtual Environments
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.venv/
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Build & Bundle Outputs
dist/
**/dist/
build/
**/build/
.next/
out/
coverage/
**/coverage/
*.js.map
*.d.ts.map
*.tsbuildinfo

# Lockfiles (high-token noise for AI context indexers)
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
uv.lock
**/uv.lock

